{"id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low-basis.md","title":"Low Basis Theorem","display":"thm-low-basis — Low Basis Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low-basis","aliases":["20-thm-low-basis"],"display":"thm-low-basis — Low Basis Theorem","chapter":"3","section":"3.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.7.2；Theorem 9.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[107,108,208],"source_printed_pages":[71,72,176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-basis — Low Basis Theorem"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.7.2；Theorem 9.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span><span>108</span><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span><span>72</span><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{Low}_1(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{Low}_1(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(e)\\uparrow\\}\">\\(U_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_{e,|\\sigma|}^{\\sigma}(e)\\uparrow\\}\\)</span>，这是可计算、向下闭合的二值树。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0=T\">\\(T_0=T\\)</span> 递归定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{e+1}=\\begin{cases}T_e\\cap U_e&amp; T_e\\cap U_e\\text{ 无限},\\\\T_e&amp;\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{e+1}=\\begin{cases}T_e\\cap U_e&amp; T_e\\cap U_e\\text{ 无限},\\\\T_e&amp;\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span> 都是无限可计算树，其指标序列由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 计算，因为有限性有一个有限空层见证。注意是计算树的指标，不要求整序列统一普通可计算。</p>\n<p>嵌套紧致性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\bigcap_e[T_e]\">\\(X\\in\\bigcap_e[T_e]\\)</span>。黑情形下所有前缀都避开有界停止，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^X(e)\\uparrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^X(e)\\uparrow\\)</span>；白情形下发散树有限，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T_e]\">\\([T_e]\\)</span> 路径的充分长前缀都会出现停止，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^X(e)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^X(e)\\downarrow\\)</span>。因此第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个选择恰决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;(e)\">\\(X&#39;(e)\\)</span>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(X&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。一般跳跃性质给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\\le_T X&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\le_T X&#39;\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_1(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_1(X)\\)</span>。空类时不作存在性结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.7.2、Theorem 9.2.2；印刷 71–72 / PDF 107–108。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jum